  "not_for": "measured color response, calibrated QE, or product-accurate colorimetry",
  "method": "Use a fixed color-resist real index close to public image-sensor high-n material guidance and derive effective k(lambda) from representative RGB transmission envelopes at 0.65 um reference thickness. Per-sensor CFA thickness then rescales absorption with Beer-Lambert law.",
