      "used_for": "Representative image-sensor functional-material refractive index: high-n 1.7 at 550 nm."
    },
    {
      "name": "Fujifilm RGB Color Mosaic application page",
      "url": "https://www.fujifilm.com/us/en/business/semiconductor-materials/image-sensor-color-mosaic/rgb/applications",
      "used_for": "Image-sensor RGB color resist application and RGB transmission/color-separation context."
    },
    {
      "name": "Taguchi, Technology of color filter materials for image sensor, International Image Sensor Workshop 2011",
      "url": "https://imagesensors.org/Past%20Workshops/2011%20Workshop/2011%20Papers/I01_Taguchi_ColorFilter.pdf",
      "used_for": "Representative modern RGB spectral design constraints: blue peak improvement, low blue leakage around 540/700 nm, red slope shifted longer, green bottom transmittance around 5%."
    },
    {
      "name": "Flexcompute Tidy3D CMOS RGB image sensor example",
      "url": "https://www.flexcompute.com/tidy3d/examples/notebooks/CMOSRGBSensor/",
      "used_for": "FDTD modeling pattern: absorptive dispersive RGB filter materials; imaginary index k is the key fitted quantity. Their material is explicitly hypothetical, so it is not copied as measured data."
    },
    {
      "name": "TOPPAN color filter and micro lens for image sensors",
      "url": "https://www.toppan.com/en/electronics/colorfilter/imagesensor/",
      "used_for": "Industry context: RGB/CMYG color filters are directly formed on sensor wafers and spectral characteristics are customer/application tuned."
    }
  ],
